# Key Learnings

### 1. Digital Footprints Grow Quickly

Using multiple online services increases the amount of information that may be collected across platforms.

---

### 2. AI Can Explain Privacy Concepts Clearly

Interactive dashboards make complex cybersecurity topics easier to understand.

---

### 3. Facts vs Estimates Matter

Responsible AI should clearly distinguish verified information from inferred insights.

---

### 4. Better Prompting Produces Better Dashboards

A structured prompt resulted in a polished, interactive HTML application with meaningful visualizations.

